  "description": "Type the 409 calls into a stopped sandbox get: {\"code\": \"machine_not_running\", \"message\": \"Sandbox bx_\u2026 is stopped. Run `boat resume bx_\u2026`, then retry.\"}. Observed live 2026-11-07 on POST /sandboxes/{id}/commands and GET /sandboxes/{id}/files.",
